(2, 9, 'High electricity demand during office operations', 'Replaced conventional perimeter lights with energy-efficient LED fixtures', 'Continue replacing remaining conventional lighting fixtures with LED technology throughout the campus.', '2026-07-21 01:21:13', '2026-07-21 01:21:13'),
